  "sound": "Saw with a triangle an octave down. Env 3 kicks oscillator A's pitch 3 semitones at the start of each note and falls back in 60 ms, and Env 4 lets B frequency-modulate A for a 150 ms growl; harder notes growl harder. Both envelopes return to zero, so the note stays in tune once the transient is over.",
